# Google Maps Platform API Key (NEVER commit your real .env file)
#
# Option A: Free Zero-Billing Maps Demo Key (Prototyping)
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card required)
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms
# 4. Click to generate/reveal your key and paste it below
#
# Option B: Production Google Cloud API Key
# Enable these APIs in Google Cloud Console:
# - Maps JavaScript API
# - Places API (New)
# - Address Validation API
# - Routes API
# - Maps Static API
# Restrict your key by HTTP referrer (frontend) and IP/API restrictions (server).
# Guide: https://developers.google.com/maps/api-security-best-practices?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0

GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
